- **Granite Falls cluster (NSP/Minnesota) — the one I'd watch.** `Granite Falls 230/115 Transformer #2` starts **today 14:00** → 08-20, overlapping `Granite Falls – Minnesota Valley Tap NSP/Panther 230 kV` (two circuits, 08-11 → 08-17). Two overlapping outages at one station, one of them brand new, in the **same NSP/WAUE region already producing the Brookings–Aurora binding**. A new 115/230 constraint here is the most likely surprise on the board.
