- `Canton Lake – Southard 138 kV` (08-10 → 08-27, OKGE west).
- `Med Park Jct – Cache Junction 138 kV` (08-10 → 08-18, WFEC/Lawton — near the Duncan transformer I'm shorting; if a constraint appears here it argues against SHORT-1).
- `Axtell – Holdrege 115 kV` (→ 08-16 17:00) and `Doss Interchange 115/69 XFMR` (→ 08-17 18:00) — both expire on/just after the bid date, so any binding is partial-day.

