## Gaps

- **Tomorrow's DA has not cleared** (run fired 08:03 CT, `dt` = today). All DA evidence is a one-day-lagged proxy. This is the biggest single caveat on the whole board.
- **PDF window 08-01 → 08-07 does not reach the bid date** — 8 days stale. **20 of 39 candidates have no section**: `ln29eveng3-29ga`, `lnanadarko-sequoyah`, `lnarcad7-jones_ka`, `lnatl1091-carthage`, `lnbrook_ln-junctn5`, `lnclevlnd7-clev_aec`, `lncommtap4-bois_tap`, `lnfulton_c-pat_wx`, `lnharbingr-walkmy1`, `lnjeff-aubu`, `lnksc10-farb`, `lnmanfl7-clec_pel`, `lnmarshal3-knob`, `lnnormhll-turner4`, `lnsiouxfl-moodyco`, `pssooner-sooner`, `xfmrholcom1-holcom1`, `xfmrlex1611-lex1611`, `xfmrmidj-midj`, `xfmrsheffld1-sheffld1`. Every call on those rests on RT and zonal evidence alone.
- **26 of 39 candidates fell back to zone 4** (sheet has 59 mappings, none for them). Their wind/load attribution was measured against the wrong zone's forecast and is low-confidence — this affects LONG-3, LONG-7, LONG-8, LONG-9 and SHORT-7, SHORT-8 directly.
- **Expired PDF triggers, verified against `sched_outages`:** Walters 2 (→08-13), Seminole–Pittsburg PITTSB9 (→08-07), Stockton–Morgan (→08-06), Arbuckle–Vanoss / Sulphur–Arbuckle (→08-05), CRIVRAEP XF1 (→08-14), SHEF 422 (→08-12), Norge Rd–SW Power Station (→ today 17:00).
- **No seasonal precedent** in 2025-08-08→08-24 for 11 of the 12 newcomers I checked — only `lnvinetap3-nhays` has one. `lnbrookngs-aurorawa`, `lnhoyt-54mr`, `lnraun-tekamho`, `xfmrsheffld1-sheffld1`, `lnnormhll-turner4`, `xfmrbrook_ln-brook_ln` and others have no history in that window at all, so their frequency evidence is 30-day only.
- **Dropped, insufficient evidence, stated rather than hidden:** `lnraun-tekamho` (2/30, RT on 08-13/14 then nothing, lift does not separate — load 0.77 / wind -0.49, no precedent); `xfmrsheffld1-sheffld1` (2/30, its SHEF 422 outage expired 08-12, already fading); `lnnormhll-turner4` (4/30, lift 19.0 but on a 0.0006 baseline ≈ 10 hours in 17,496 — statistically thin); `lnclevlnd7-clev_aec`, `xfmrmidj-midj`, `lnksc10-farb`, `lnmarshal3-knob`, `lnatl1091-carthage` (RT and DA track closely — correctly priced, no edge either way).
- No uplift call raised; `predict_tomorrow_percentile` returned a full 144-row frame (6 zones × 24 h) with no missing dates. Sheet read clean: 1,198 rows, latest `bid_date` 2026-08-15.

No writes were made to the sheet.

